          "en-US": "Patchwork is a developer-focused task manager built with Expo and React Native.\n\nFeatures:\n\n* CalDAV task sync (Nextcloud and other CalDAV servers)\n* Nextcloud Deck boards\n* AI-assisted task drafting and import from photos or notes\n* Custom AI model providers (OpenAI-compatible endpoints)\n* GitHub issue tracking\n* Android home-screen widgets\n\nReleases are built with EAS, published on GitHub Releases, and mirrored into\nthis F-Droid-compatible repository.\n"
        },
